			PRINTFORML 「They're rare, but they don't have a lot of meat, so there's not much reason to go out of your way to catch one, you know.」
		CASE 52
			PRINTFORML 「This one's a little bird that has a really distinct song.」
		CASE 53,54
			PRINTFORML 「Sure enough, this is what catching birds is all about～」
			PRINTFORML 「It's big and it tastes great, so there's nothing else to say!」
	ENDSELECT
		IF !RAND:5
			IF ABL:料理技能 >= 2 && ABL:教養 >= 2 && RAND:2 && GROUPMATCH(TFLAG:194, 15,16,17,27,28)
				PRINTFORML 「Once you've finished cleaning it, take the stomach and stuff it with chopped offal and all the other scrap meat, just like this!」
				PRINTFORML 「That way you won't waste any meat, it's easy to carry, and you can drop it in a stew just like this. Super convenient, isn't it?」
				PRINTFORMDL It looks a little bit like a haggis...
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「When you go to clean your kill, don't stop the heart immediately, it's easier to drain the blood while it's still beating!」
			ENDIF
		ENDIF
	ELSEIF TFLAG:193 == 10
		IF FIRSTTIME("虫トラップ")
			PRINTFORMW 「Bugs, huh. Can't say I'm a fan.」
			PRINTFORMW 「One time when there was no other food, I had no choice but to eat some. Even though they tasted alright, it really drove home how poor I am...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Huh? You don't plan to eat them?」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「It's crazy how you go to such lengths to catch these when you aren't even going to eat them.」
			PRINTFORML 「What a time-consuming hobby you have...」
		ENDIF
	ELSEIF TFLAG:193 == 0
		IF !RAND:7
			PRINTFORML 「Hey wait, it's fine to set a trap, but why are you leaving the disturbed soil right there?」
			PRINTFORML 「If something smells weird, the prey will notice, so we need to dump the waste soil someplace further away.」
		ELSEIF !RAND:5
			PRINTFORML 「%TEXTR("It's nice that there's a little choke point here/Judging from the tracks, it looks like they're walking along there/Look, there's a mud wallow right here/If you look at it from the perspective of a four-legged animal, they'd see it right away, so let's change it up a bit/I think this is a good spot")%...」
		ENDIF
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1
