		CASE 0
			PRINTFORML 「Muuー Doing this for others is harder than I thought...」
			PRINTFORMW 「It's a bit scary, since it feels like any mistake will just pierce right through...」
		CASE 1
			PRINTFORML 「Yes yes, it's not like there's much to clean anyway.」
			PRINTFORMW 「... Or so I thought. That's no good, you have to properly take care of yourself.」
		CASE 2
			PRINTFORML 「Which reminds me, I have to deal with these ears here as well.」
			PRINTFORML 「That's why my grooming is a little more troublesome.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I usually take a cloth and wipe wipe～ for these ears.」
		CASE 3
			PRINTFORML 「As long as you're fine with it, then it's fine, but...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Is this sloppy ear cleaning really okay, I wonder?」
		CASE 4
			PRINTFORML 「I wonder if I could use one of my claws for this.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Look, even without transforming I can still lengthen it out this much.」
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW She shows you a long, sharp claw that glints dangerously in the light.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMW 「Hahaha... It was a joke, a joke...」
		ENDSELECT
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 0
